 "segments": [
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Aboard the intergalactic restaurant in the year 2114, Chef Barinov calls out alien seafood dishes to his cooks until a glowing hologram of Dmitry Nagiyev beams in with an urgent warning.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Федя, где треска в марсианской соли?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Лёва, курица скоро будет готова?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Да, шеф, ещё пара секунд.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Шеф, вам сейчас Нагиев звонит.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Скоро к нам прилетит император галактики!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Дима, надо заранее предупреждать!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Витя, это совершенно невозможно.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Жизнь этих существ — семь часов.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Родился, поел и сразу умер.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Не волнуйся, Дима, всё сделаем.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Примем гостя по высшему разряду!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Правильно, иначе нам всем конец.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Let's examine each line of the space-kitchen orders.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Федя, где треска в марсианской соли?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Fedya, where is the cod in Martian salt?' Even on Mars a hundred years from now, Fedya is still frying cod in the kitchen.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Лёва, курица скоро будет готова?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Lyova, will the chicken be ready soon?' The feminine short-form adjective 'ready' agrees with 'chicken'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Да, шеф, ещё пара секунд.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Yes, chef, just a couple more seconds.' The noun for 'pair/couple' governs the genitive plural of 'seconds'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Шеф, вам сейчас Нагиев звонит.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Chef, Nagiyev is calling you right now.' Lyova points to the futuristic communicator.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Скоро к нам прилетит император галактики!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Soon the Emperor of the Galaxy will fly in to us!' The verb 'will arrive by air/space' fits an intergalactic VIP.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Дима, надо заранее предупреждать!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Dima, you have to warn me in advance!' The adverb 'in advance' pairs with the imperfective infinitive 'to warn'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Витя, это совершенно невозможно.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Vitya, that is completely impossible.' Hologram Nagiyev shakes his head at the complaint.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Жизнь этих существ — семь часов.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'The lifespan of these creatures is seven hours.' Numbers from five upward require the genitive plural ('seven hours').",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Родился, поел и сразу умер.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Born, ate a meal, and died right away.' Three rapid masculine past-tense verbs summarize the alien emperor's seven-hour life.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Не волнуйся, Дима, всё сделаем.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Do not worry, Dima, we will do everything.' The reflexive command 'do not worry' reassures the owner.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Примем гостя по высшему разряду!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'We will host the guest in first-class style!' The idiom 'by the highest grade' means 'first-class' or 'royally'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Правильно, иначе нам всем конец.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Right, otherwise it is the end for all of us.' The conjunction 'otherwise' warns of galactic consequences if dinner is late. Now listen to the whole space-kitchen scene again at natural speed.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Федя, где треска в марсианской соли?",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
